{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.leray_profile","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.leray_profile","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.leray_profile","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.leray_profile","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean#L54-L65","doc":"**Leray-profile reconstruction** ([`prop:leray-profile`]).\n\n`V(0) = Σ_n V_coeff n` — *derived* by evaluating the finite ansatz\n`profile_expansion` at `0` and applying the basis normalisation\n(`mul_one` per component).\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:leray-profile}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:leray-profile","label":"prop:leray-profile","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/leray-profile.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.profile_expansion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.profile_expansion","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean#L52-L52","doc":"**Finite ansatz (the representation-theoretic input):** `V` is the\nfinite sum of its weight components. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.basis_at_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.basis_at_zero","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean#L49-L49","doc":"**Normalisation:** each basis entry equals `1` at the origin. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.basis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.basis","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Weight-`n` matrix-entry basis functions of the ansatz. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.V_coeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.V_coeff","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean#L45-L45","doc":"Ansatz coefficients, fixed by the singular gerbe data\n`(Σ, n*, κ_{n*})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.j_max","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.j_max","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Maximum spin level `j_max` in the finite-dimensional ansatz. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.V","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The Leray profile `V` on the rescaled coordinate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.LerayProfileContext","kind":"class","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/leray_profile.lean#L34-L52","doc":"Hypotheses for the finite-dimensional Leray profile (§7c: generic\n`CommRing`, no `ℝ`).  `basis n` are the weight-`n` matrix entries of\nthe `SU_q(2)` ansatz, normalised to `1` at the origin of the rescaled\ncoordinate; `profile_expansion` is the finite ansatz itself. ","signatureChunk":0}]}